================================================================================
DATA
================================================================================

No data is distributed in this repository.

The physician panel analysed in the case study contains attributes inferred from
photographs of identifiable individuals. These constitute sensitive personal
information under the Personal Information Protection Law of the People's
Republic of China and under Article 9 of the General Data Protection Regulation.
The data is not redistributed under any license. The analysis code accepts a
path to a local copy.

The 63 public datasets used in the evaluation are retrieved at runtime from the
Rdatasets collection and remain under their original licenses.
